-- The first eight outputs cover every ordinary field upgrade module. Six are
-- the modules assembled by Azot; the reload and caliber kits complete the
-- standard set. Combining all eight and one Absolute assembles either anomalous
-- module. The remaining recipes assemble armor components and field devices.
